# landmark (assets/world3d/bothy/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Badger's Bothy: the sett, a turfed mound over the back with a round door in
# its slope, a thatched porch and a tall stone chimney; a woodshed east.
sphere   grass   at 92 0 -10 size 124 46 52 id bothy-mound
arch-6   stone   at 92 0 11.5 size 34 32 8 id bothy-door-arch
box      door    at 92 0 13.3 size 18 21 1.5 id bothy-door
